3. PUBLIC RECORDS — assets/documents/
-------------------------------------
The PDF documents under assets/documents/ are public records obtained from
Arkansas state agencies through Freedom of Information Act requests, reproduced
without alteration. They are government records, not original works of the
campaign, and the campaign claims no copyright in them. Reuse them freely, and
verify them against the issuing agencies where accuracy matters.


